WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.670
- The dominoes are already
starting to fall against Newsmax

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.510
and the defamation lawsuits
that they are facing.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.830
Former Dominion executive Eric
Coomer has already settled

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:09.790
with Newsmax.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.340
The terms of the settlement are not known,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.840
but Newsmax had to issue a huge retraction

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.000
against the allegations that
they made against Eric Coomer,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.870
and this is very, very
common in litigation.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.030
Often you will give a better
deal to the defendants

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.310
who are willing to settle early

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:25.460
and those funds can then
be used to fund the rest

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.450
of the litigation and
get the big money items

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.340
from the remaining defendants.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.330
So at least in the Eric Coomer
suit, Newsmax gets out early

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.040
but there are a lot of
defendants that remain.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.753
So we'll see them in court.

